Subject: [PATCH 15/15] ARM: sun5i: a10s-olinuxino: Enable HDMI
Date: Tue,  7 Mar 2017 09:56:34 +0100
Message-Id: <3194cb69fa565ded062ea950d5bf72fd7886e3f8.1488876832.git-series.maxime.ripard@free-electrons.com>
